<title>USA: HA-LO completes Creative Concepts buy.</title>
<headline>HA-LO completes Creative Concepts buy.</headline>
<dateline>NILES, Ill. 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>HA-LO Industries Inc said Monday it completed the previously announced acquisition of Creative Concepts In Advertising Inc of Beverly Hills, Mich., for 2.85 million shares.</p>
<p>Privately held Creative Concepts has 60 sales people and has projected 1997 revenues of about $100 million.</p>
<p>HA-LO distributes advertising specialty and promotional products.</p>
<p>	     ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
</text>
